%slow_pct_tooltip%%% and attacking them with bonus damage if it is an enemy.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_damage", "slow", "slow_pct_tooltip", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "riki_tricks_of_the_trade", "name_zh": "力丸·绝杀秘技", "name_en": "Tricks of the Trade", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 力丸转移出现实位面，每隔一段时间从背后随机攻击附近的%interval_targets%个随机敌方单位。期间他的攻击伤害为固定值。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Riki phases out of the world and periodically strikes %interval_targets% random enemy units from behind in an area around him. He has fixed attack damage while phased out.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升施法距离至%AbilityCastRange%。可以对友方单位施放，持续时间内藏在他们体内。藏在友方单位体内时，他会拥有%scepter_movespeed%%%移动速度加成，同时绝杀秘技的持续时间提升%scepter_bonus_duration%秒，并且额外发动%scepter_bonus_attacks%次攻击。", "en": "Increases Cast Range to %AbilityCastRange%. Allows you to target an allied unit, hiding inside them for the duration. While hiding in an allied unit, they have %scepter_movespeed%%% bonus movement speed, and Tricks of the Trade lasts %scepter_bonus_duration%s longer and does an additional %scepter_bonus_attacks% attacks."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "attack_count", "speed_per_attack", "interval_targets", "attack_damage", "base_attack_damage_pct", "pocket_riki_enabled", "scepter_movespeed", "scepter_bonus_duration", "scepter_bonus_attacks", "creep_agility_multiplier", "cooldown_reduction_per_creep_kill", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "riki_innate_backstab", "name_zh": "力丸·背刺", "name_en": "Backstab", "description_zh": "力丸每次从背后攻击敌人时都会造成额外伤害，伤害量为自身敏捷的一定倍数。", "description_en": "Every 